<p>But&#8230; I thought those were just flamboyant, hyperbolic names for some non-anomalous things like a recorder and stuff. I assumed the cabinet was enchanted to never open because a magician never reveals his secrets, and again, the corpse of Fuller is being tugged about by wires. I reiterate that an extremely competent engineer could achieve this in real life.<br />
