<blockquote>
<p>Corpse Fuller even states that he wants to catch and torture the dynamic duo, which is not something I'd say through the mouth of my archnemesis.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Ah&#8230;</p>
<p>&quot;The electro-thaumic waves on the cylinder <strong>do not precisely match up with these two lines</strong>. It should also be noted that SCP-3440-A1's voice abruptly changes to be significantly more enraged.&quot;</p>
<p>The implication here is that this is <strong>not</strong> what Icky said, but rather Fuller himself managing to push through a little bit.</p>
<p>As for them getting his personality spot on, Icky is a professional showwoman and they both knew him extremely well. Icky worked under him for almost forty years, and Manny for about three times that, plus Manny has mind powers.</p>
<p>And when he did gain control of his body, that control was limited and for a limited amount of time, plus he's probably lost his mind a bit. The accuracy of the performance is not something he'd be terribly concerned with.</p>

